ThisIsAComment: 这是一个测试注释
ThisIsAComment: ThisIsAComment: 无限套娃注释，随便写多少字都可以

TheReturnValueTypeOfTheFunctionIsADecimalNumberWithFloatingPoint
ThisIsTheFunctionThatStartsTheProgram() {
    TheTypeOfTheVariableIsADecimalNumberWithFloatingPoint
    TheNameOfTheVariableThatStoresHalfValueIs halfValue
    AndTheInitialValueAssignedToTheVariableIs 0.5 ;
    ThisIsTheEndOfALineOfCode ;
    PrintTheGivenContentOntoTheConsoleScreenInReadableFormat ( halfValue * 3 ) ;
    PrintTheGivenContentOntoTheConsoleScreenInReadableFormat ( halfValue / 2 ) ;
    PrintTheGivenContentOntoTheConsoleScreenInReadableFormat ( 2 > 1 ) ;
    PrintTheGivenContentOntoTheConsoleScreenInReadableFormat ( "a" == "a" ) ;
    PrintTheGivenContentOntoTheConsoleScreenInReadableFormat ( "再" + "见" ) ;
    TheFunctionShallNowReturnTheFollowingValueBackToCaller ( 0 ) ;
    ThisIsTheEndOfALineOfCode ;
}
